@jjlawren 

The existing [`device_attr`](https://www.home-assistant.io/docs/configuration/templating/#devices) templating function appears to get a device's data stored in `core.device_registry`. However, there's no equivalent function (i.e. `entity_attr`) for getting an entity's data stored in `core.entity_registry`. If it existed, it would be trivial to get `capabilities.source_list`. 

Do you think this would be a viable Feature Request? Or do you know of any prevailing guideline to avoid even read-only access to `core.entity_registry`?
